113			{"closed-negative beats gotcha cue", nil, "beware: query expansion was tried and failed at larger n", factKindClosedNegative},
114			{"invariant cue with no taxonomy", nil, "the cursor must always be monotonic", factKindInvariant},
115			{"default decision with no signal", nil, "the team shipped the feature", factKindDecision},
116			// Multi-path tie-break: the invariant signal of constraints.* must win over
117			// an alphabetically-earlier architecture co-tag (not be dropped), in both
118			// path orderings.
